# Brain Providers â€” Canonical CE Registry

## Principle

```yaml
provider_model: |
  BrainProvider  = high-level SIO executor  (brain/master/provider/)
  BrainRuntime   = low-level CE trait        (brain/base â€” BrainKernel + BrainRuntime)
  
  brain/master ProviderRegistry selects BrainProvider by Capability.
  BrainProvider.execute() delegates to ZeusRuntime (BrainKernel trait).
  ZeusRuntime.route_and_execute() selects CE by classify_complexity().
  
  Provider hierarchy (abstract â†’ concrete):
    BrainProvider (trait)
      â”œâ”€â”€ MockProvider      (tests only)
      â”œâ”€â”€ AlgoProvider      (CE.Algo â€” WORKS)
      â”œâ”€â”€ CandleProvider    (CE.Hacedle â€” STUB execute())
      â”œâ”€â”€ LlamaProvider     (CE.Llama  â€” STUB execute())
      â””â”€â”€ RemoteProvider    (CE.Remote â€” E4.5, not yet)
```

