## Provider Violations (active)

```yaml
violations:
  PROV-V01:
    file:    "brain/master/src/provider/factory.rs"
    finding: "ProviderFactory::create() always returns DummyProvider"
    code: |
      pub fn create(_cfg: &ProviderConfig) -> Option<Arc<dyn BrainProvider>> {
          Some(Arc::new(DummyProvider::default()))  // ignores cfg.provider_type
      }
    impact: "CandleProvider + LlamaProvider are NEVER instantiated"
    fix: |
      match cfg.provider_type {
          ProviderType::Candle => Some(Arc::new(CandleProvider::new())),
          ProviderType::Llama  => Some(Arc::new(LlamaProvider::new())),
          _                    => None,
      }
    owner: Cogen
    effort: "15 min"

  PROV-V02:
    file:    "brain/master/src/provider/candle/mod.rs"
    finding: "CandleProvider::execute() = Ok(SioOutcome::default())"
    impact:  "Even if factory creates CandleProvider, execute() is stub"
    fix:     "Wire execute() to ZeusRuntime { local_ce: HacedleBrain } after CE.Hacedle done"
    blocking_on: "CE.Hacedle (GAP-T5)"

  PROV-V03:
    file:    "brain/master/src/lib.rs"
    finding: "BrainMasterRuntime::execute() = Ok(SioOutcome::default())"
    impact:  "Top-level dispatch is void â€” all providers unreachable"
    fix:     "Implement InferenceEngine wire (GAP-T1)"
```

---

## Provider selection (target flow)

```yaml
target_flow: |
  BrainMasterRuntime::execute(sio)
    |
    InferRequest::from_sio(&sio)
    |
    ProviderSelector::select(req.required_capability)
      -> ProviderType::Candle  (if model loaded + CE.Hacedle ready)
      -> ProviderType::Algo    (fallback always available)
    |
    ProviderRegistry::get(provider_id) -> Arc<dyn BrainProvider>
    |
    provider.execute(&sio) -> SioOutcome
      -> CandleProvider: extract prompt -> ZeusRuntime -> HacedleBrain
      -> AlgoProvider:   extract prompt -> AlgoParticle

capability_map:
  Capability::Inference: "CandleProvider or LlamaProvider"
  Capability::Embedding: "CandleProvider (embed only)"
  Capability::Reasoning: "AlgoProvider (rule-based)"
  Capability::Remote:    "RemoteProvider (E4.5)"
```
